<report>
<line><title>Single sample t test</title></line>
<line></line>
<line>Sample name: <in>name</in></line>
<line>Sample mean = <inu>sam_mean</inu></line>
<line>Population mean = <inu>pop_mean</inu></line>
<line>Sample size n = <in>size</in></line>
<line>Sample sd = <inu>sd</inu></line>
<line></line>
<line><ci><in>pc</in>% confidence interval <in>for</in> = <inu>from</inu> to <inu>to</inu></ci></line>
<line></line>
<line>df = <in>df</in></line>
<line>t  = <inu>t</inu></line>
<line></line>
<line><pval>One sided <inp>p_1</inp></pval></line>
<line><pval>Two sided <inp>p_2</inp></pval></line>
<line></line>
<line>Power <in>pwr</in></line>
</report>
